 "sentences": [
  "Future planetary scientists are learning public engagement skills.",
  "NASA SCoPE partnered with Arizona State University's FORCE Summer School in Summer 2026.",
  "Seven undergraduate interns built skills to share their research.",
  "FORCE uses high-pressure equipment to recreate extreme conditions deep within planets.",
  "Interns learned to translate technical research into compelling stories.",
  "Training culminated in an open house and a poster session for the university community."
